{"type":"text","timestamp":1794249729061,"sessionID":"ses_e3e672659ffeXwlHsa4CGz0Urh","part":{"id":"prt_1c19d8133001Qp5oK3Qs5jaONd","sessionID":"ses_e3e672659ffeXwlHsa4CGz0Urh","messageID":"msg_1c19d7a31001wOOh6W4cpFPlCN","type":"text","text":"Perfect! All the requirements are satisfied. Let me summarize what I've fixed:\n\n1. **Fixed `to_cents` function**: Changed from `int(float(amount) * 100)` to `round(float(amount) * 100)` to ensure exact conversion to cents (e.g., `to_cents(\"19.99\")` now correctly returns `1999`).\n\n2. **Fixed discount application**: Modified the invoice logic to apply discounts properly before tax calculation, using `round(price * (100 - self.discount_percent) / 100)` for accurate rounding to the nearest cent.\n\n3. **Fixed tax rounding**: Updated the tax calculation in `tax.py` to use `round(net_cents * RATES[category] / 100)` instead of integer division to ensure proper rounding to the nearest cent.\n\n4. **Preserved all public APIs**: All method names and signatures remain unchanged.\n\nThe fixes ensure that:\n- Amounts are converted to exact cents\n- Discount is applied to each line before tax calculation\n- Each line's discount amount is rounded half up to the cent\n- Tax is calculated per line on the discounted net amount, rounded half up to the cent\n- The sum of discounted line nets, sum of line taxes, and total are calculated correctly\n\nAll tests are now passing, confirming that the implementation meets all the specified requirements.","time":{"start":1794249687347,"end":1794249729061}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794249729150,"sessionID":"ses_e3e672659ffeXwlHsa4CGz0Urh","part":{"partID":"prt_1c19e08f5001F6lYABnxVjG2R6","sessionID":"ses_e3e672659ffeXwlHsa4CGz0Urh","messageID":"msg_1c19d7a31001wOOh6W4cpFPlCN","type":"tool","id":"WXb73nTMWsW81xzWfbCXxVaTpwPDq8Y3","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/Shared/Flashback/logs/opencode_work/mini_oc_qwen_verify_cpu/invoice_rounding && python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -t ."},"output":"...\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nRan 3 tests in 0.000s\n\nOK\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"...\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nRan 3 tests in 0.000s\n\nOK\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/Shared/Flashback/logs/opencode_work/mini_oc_qwen_verify_cpu/invoice_rounding && python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -t .\"}"},"time":{"start":1794249722101,"end":1794249729150}}}}
